SUMMARY:New Jersey Keys to Tenancy: Know Your Rights and Know Your Neighbors
DESCRIPTION:Montclair Public Library invites you to learn more about your rights as a tenant and meet your neighbors at our “New Jersey Keys to Tenancy” kick-off event! Join us for: \nA presentation on NJ Tenant Rights with Volunteer Lawyers for Justice\nThe premiere of Keys to Tenancy explainer video\nPanel and Q&A with local professionals\nMixer with food and refreshments\nBe one of the first 50 people to register and get a free copy of Mutual Aid: Building Solidarity During This Crisis (and the Next) by Dean Spade! \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
