SUMMARY:2-for-1 TWOsdays
DESCRIPTION:Every 1st Tuesday of the month\, your day pass = entry for TWO. \nThat means you and a buddy can cowork\, jam\, and caffeinate together for just $39. \nNo codes. No awkward signup hoops. Just great vibes\, great company & a great deal. \nWork vibes + friend energy + saving money = a very good Tuesday. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
