SUMMARY:Set Up a Vendor Table that Sells
DESCRIPTION:At craft fairs and markets\, some vendor tables get mobbed. Others get ignored. The difference? Setup strategy. Shoppers are overwhelmed and filtering fast—your table has mere seconds to make them stop. Join us for this virtual Power Hour where we’ll share what separates the tables that sell from the tables that blend in. Discover the product placement formulas\, visual merchandising tricks\, and shopper psychology that turn browsers into buyers. Learn engagement tactics that actually work and budget-friendly display solutions that make your table unforgettable. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
