SUMMARY:The Long Game Parenting: What Schools & Screens Are Doing to Our Kids
DESCRIPTION:Your child’s school issued them a Chromebook. Do you know what’s on it?\nOn June 4th at 6pm\, The Long Game Parenting is bringing together local parents at the RecRoom at Lackawanna Plaza in Montclair to talk about what’s actually going on in our schools — and what we can do about it.\nFree event. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
