SUMMARY:Roses to Rock Gardens Tour
DESCRIPTION:Step inside some of the most beautiful private gardens in and around Montclair—spaces you wouldn’t normally get to see. Each stop on the Roses to Rock Gardens Tour offers something different: lush rose gardens in full bloom\, thoughtfully designed landscapes\, hidden backyard retreats\, and creative plantings that reflect the personalities of the people who care for them. Whether you’re a serious gardener\, a design lover\, or just someone who enjoys a beautiful afternoon outdoors\, this tour is a chance to gather ideas\, inspiration\, and a fresh appreciation for what a garden can be. \nStart your day at Van Vleck House & Gardens to pick up the printed guide of the garden tour addresses\, then explore at your own pace. We have 9 fabulous private gardens to visit in Montclair\, Glen Ridge and Verona! \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
