SUMMARY:Fletcher's Listening Room Presents Aurora Nealand
DESCRIPTION:Fletcher’s Listening Room presents Aurora Nealand on June 5\, 2026. \nAurora Nealand lives at the intersection of Lunatic and Librarian. She is a versatile American saxophonist\, clarinetist\, singer\, and composer based in New Orleans. Known for her impeccable musicianship and adventurous spirit\, she is a prominent figure in the city’s music scene\, leading several diverse projects that range from traditional jazz to experimental sound art. \n$20\, BYO. Doors open 7:30pm\, show starts at 8pm. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
